    "detailed_description": "DinoLife is a casual Dinosaur farming game with life-sim elements. <br><br>In DinoLife you hatch and tend to many Dinosaurs, upgrade your town and Dinosaur pens all while bettering your relationship with the residents and customising your personal spaces.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Collect, hatch and earn money from different dinosaurs.<br></li><li> Attempt to hatch the most appealing dinosaurs to earn more money.<br></li><li> Feed your dinos.<br></li><li> Complete missions and interact with NPCs.<br></li><li> Become friends with NPCs.<br></li><li> Buy items to place within your house and even save to buy your own house.</li></ul>",
